{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01JNfDgL2ET43LSHsd6C2Ni5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LAUawgWZuvpEDpDTF67JV1","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Re-review updated plan","prompt":"Review this updated optimization plan following the review guideline. This is a second review after the first review identified two design-level blockers (missing buffer_size/intermediates_offset fields, varying buffer_size handling) and a pattern mismatch (binary search vs BlockCtx). The plan has been updated to address all of these.\n\nRead the following files:\n\n1. `autoopt/review_guideline.md` — the review standard to follow\n2. `autoopt-results/task.md` — the task being planned\n3. `autoopt-results/2026-04-15-0100-batch-global-gkr-input-eval/plan.md` — the UPDATED plan to review\n\nThen check the actual code at:\n- `crates/cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/gkr_input.cu` — the CUDA kernel being extended\n- `crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/gkr_input.rs` — the Rust orchestration code\n- `crates/cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle.cu` — the BlockCtx pattern being reused\n\nVerify that the previous review's blockers have been resolved:\n1. Does the descriptor now include buffer_size and intermediates_offset?\n2. Is the varying buffer_size across AIRs properly handled?\n3. Does the plan now use the BlockCtx pattern correctly (not binary search)?\n\nAlso verify:\n- The intermediates layout with stride=1 and per-thread contiguous scratch is correct for single-tile processing\n- The concurrent execution model (batched kernel on background stream + workers on thread streams) is sound\n- Any remaining design-level blockers\n\nReturn your response in the format: Findings, Improvements, Assessment."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4225,"cache_read_input_tokens":205419,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4225},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c4196e5-21f2-4e88-ab6f-fb2d2870d4db","uuid":"c7efa073-353a-41de-9f54-175841de7b3c"}
